<title>USA: TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, California 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$303,000 Sybase Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>3-Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 4-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>4-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Jim Grabb (U.S.) 6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>7-Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>8-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 6-3</p>
<p>4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Grant Doyle (Australia) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
